  "cards": [
    {
      "dot": "cyan",
      "title": "Context economy",
      "items": [
        "A catalog of hundreds of tools never enters the prompt: the agent sees five meta tools",
        "list_commands returns the catalog on demand and caches it",
        "describe_commands sends the schema of just the tool being called",
        "invoke_many runs a batch in one answer instead of N round-trips",
        "maxBytes cuts a large answer; the whole text stays in a file"
      ]
    },
    {
      "dot": "emerald",
      "title": "The agent works as usual",
      "items": [
        "The harness does not change: the same tools/call and JSON-RPC on /mcp",
        "Tool names stay real: invoke_command{server, command_name, parameters}",
        "Errors come back as tool text: unknown server, unknown tool",
        "Stats count calls and errors per server; health is polled periodically"
      ]
    },
    {
      "dot": "rose",
      "title": "Transports and tokens",
      "items": [
        "stdio: spawn(command) + its own env, initialize handshake",
        "HTTP: server/discover, OAuth on 401",
        "One Bearer token per set; each client can have its own set",
        "A set runs as a child of the panel or as its own unit"
      ]
    },
    {
      "dot": "rose",
      "title": "Sandbox",
      "items": [
        "untrusted without a sandbox never starts: fail-closed",
        "ro replaces the defaults entirely — list the paths you need",
        "prlimit from the host (alpine: util-linux); limits AS/NPROC/FSIZE",
        "node: memoryMb ≥ 2048 and ro on the node prefix",
        "Isolation: /home, network, /proc/1, writes to the root"
      ]
    }
  ]
